                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d61f26'>Glossary</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#d61f26'> tab for the definition of the metrics.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#d61f26'>Select </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#d61f26' fontname='Tableau Semibold'>Benchmark Type </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#d61f26'>to view metrics using different benchmarks. </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#d61f26'>Shortlist the </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d61f26'>PIM Level 1/2 names</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#d61f26'>, and select the </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d61f26'>Account Manager.</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#d61f26'>Æ </run>
